    "description": "This accession contains ocean temperature and salinity profiles from CTD and bottle samples collected aboard the USCGC Healy and R/V Sikuliaq during cruises HLY1301 and SKQ201505s, respectively, in the Bering Sea and Chukchi Sea between 2013-08-03 and 2015-04-03.  These data were collected by Christopher R. Paver (NCEI) and Dr. Louis A. Codispoti (UMCES) conducting research on bottle flushing protocol.  These data were submitted by Christopher R. Paver.",
